{"id":2198,"date":"2026-08-26T20:30:03","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T20:30:03","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2198"},"modified":"2026-08-26T22:54:31","modified_gmt":"2026-08-26T22:54:31","slug":"the-dashboard","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/dashboard\/the-dashboard\/","title":{"rendered":"The Dashboard"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Dashboard<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2237\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDashboard.webp\" alt=\"The Dashboard\" width=\"127\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDashboard.webp 900w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDashboard-284x300.webp 284w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDashboard-768x812.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">When you open Open Publisher, the <strong>Dashboard<\/strong> appears at <strong>Startup <\/strong> as a large, centred modal window giving you instant access to your template library, recent work, and new document creation &#8211; all before you touch the editor. It can also be reopened at any time without restarting the application.<\/p>\n<p align=\"center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2206\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-26-213749.webp\" alt=\"Opening the Dashboard\" width=\"802\" height=\"451\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-26-213749.webp 1919w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-26-213749-300x169.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-26-213749-1024x576.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-26-213749-768x432.webp 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-26-213749-1536x864.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 802px) 100vw, 802px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening the Dashboard<\/span><br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2229\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Copy_of_Copy_of_Copy_202608262230.jpeg\" alt=\"A Draggable Modal Window\" width=\"375\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Copy_of_Copy_of_Copy_202608262230.jpeg 1434w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Copy_of_Copy_of_Copy_202608262230-300x200.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Copy_of_Copy_of_Copy_202608262230-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Copy_of_Copy_of_Copy_202608262230-768x513.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 375px) 100vw, 375px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Dashboard opens automatically every time Open Publisher loads. If you close it and need to return to it later, you can reopen it at any time via <strong>File &gt; New &gt; Dashboard<\/strong> from the ribbon &#8211; even while you have a document open.<br \/>\nThis allows you to browse templates or start a new project without closing your current work.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">A Draggable Modal Window<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Dashboard is a <strong>95% full-screen draggable modal window<\/strong> rather than a rigid full-screen overlay. Click and drag the Dashboard header to move the entire window around your screen, letting you peek at the editor workspace beneath it. This gives you spatial context &#8211; you can see your existing document waiting underneath while you browse templates.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Browsing Templates<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2224\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrowsingTemplates.webp\" alt=\"Browsing Templates\" width=\"110\" height=\"114\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrowsingTemplates.webp 425w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BrowsingTemplates-290x300.webp 290w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 110px) 100vw, 110px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Dashboard provides access to a library of <strong>250 premium templates<\/strong> spanning categories including Resumes, Flyers, Menus, Certificates, Business Cards, Magazines, Invitations, and more. Each template thumbnail displays a <strong>page size badge<\/strong> in the bottom-right corner, showing you the format (A4, Letter, Square, 1080p, etc.) at a glance before loading it.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">The <strong>Featured<\/strong> section at the top of the Dashboard showcases 12 hand-picked, top-tier templates &#8211; including designs such as Executive Summary, Luxury Wedding, and Film Festival &#8211; ensuring<br \/>\nyou are immediately presented with the platform&#8217;s finest work.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Starting a New Document<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2220\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StartingAnNewDocument.webp\" alt=\"Starting a New Document\" width=\"109\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StartingAnNewDocument.webp 412w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StartingAnNewDocument-281x300.webp 281w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 109px) 100vw, 109px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To begin with a blank canvas, click the <strong>Skip \/ Open Editor<\/strong> button. This dismisses the Dashboard and opens a fresh blank document in the editor immediately. The button is styled as a bright white button with teal text and is always prominently visible in the Dashboard header.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Closing the Dashboard<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2215\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ClosingTheDashboard.webp\" alt=\"Closing the Dashboard\" width=\"109\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ClosingTheDashboard.webp 427w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ClosingTheDashboard-273x300.webp 273w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 109px) 100vw, 109px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Dashboard features a smart close button in the top corner that behaves differently depending on your situation:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Cold start (no document open) &#8211;<\/strong> Clicking the close button generates a fresh blank A4 page and takes you straight into the editor, identical to pressing Skip.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Active session (document already open) &#8211;<\/strong> Clicking the close button dismisses the Dashboard modal and safely returns you to your existing document without overwriting or disrupting your work.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Auto-Close on File Drop<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2211\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AutoCloseOnFileDrop.webp\" alt=\"Auto-Close on File Drop\" width=\"109\" height=\"140\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AutoCloseOnFileDrop.webp 351w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AutoCloseOnFileDrop-233x300.webp 233w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 109px) 100vw, 109px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">If you drag and drop an <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> file into the application while the Dashboard is still open, Open Publisher loads the file in the background and <strong>automatically closes the Dashboard<\/strong> the moment the document finishes rendering &#8211; taking you straight into your file without any manual dismissal needed.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Theme Compatibility<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2208\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThemeCompatibility.webp\" alt=\"Theme Compatibility\" width=\"109\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThemeCompatibility.webp 413w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThemeCompatibility-282x300.webp 282w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 109px) 100vw, 109px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Dashboard header is styled with Open Publisher&#8217;s signature teal green and white. When a high-brightness UI theme is active (such as Snapchat Yellow), the Dashboard intelligently adapts &#8211; flipping the header text, logo, and buttons to dark colours so everything remains clearly legible regardless of which theme you are using.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Dashboard When you open Open Publisher, the Dashboard appears at Startup as a large, centred modal window giving you instant access to your template library, recent work, and new document creation &#8211; all before you touch the editor. It can also be reopened at any time without restarting the application. Opening the Dashboard The [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2237,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[26],"class_list":["post-2198","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-dashboard"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2198","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2198"}],"version-history":[{"count":30,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2198\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2241,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2198\/revisions\/2241"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2237"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2198"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2198"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}